{
  "name": "Atendente de IA no WhatsApp com memoria por contato (Wafly)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Antes de ativar\n\n1. Crie a credencial **Wafly API** (Client-Token, instance, token).\n2. Ative este workflow e copie a **Production URL** do node Webhook.\n3. Registre essa URL na sua instancia, UMA VEZ:\n\n```\ncurl -X PUT \\\n  \"https://wafly.com.br/api-bridge-whats/instances/SUA_INSTANCIA/token/SEU_TOKEN/update-webhook-received\" \\\n  -H \"Client-Token: SEU_CLIENT_TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"value\":\"COLE_A_PRODUCTION_URL_AQUI\"}'\n```\n\n> Nao use a operacao `Webhook > Set Webhook` do node: ela aponta para uma rota que nao existe e retorna 404. Sera corrigida em versao futura.\n\nA Wafly entrega o payload no formato Z-API: `body.type`, `body.phone`, `body.text.message`, `body.fromMe`, `body.isGroup`.\n\nInstancia Wafly: R$ 59,90/mes, mensagens ilimitadas, teste de 3 dias sem cartao.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-360, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "wafly-atendente-ia",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-inbound",
      "name": "Wafly Inbound",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [120, 260],
      "webhookId": "REPLACE_WEBHOOK_ID"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-type",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.type }}",
              "rightValue": "ReceivedCallback",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-fromme",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.fromMe }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "false", "singleValue": true }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-group",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.isGroup }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "false", "singleValue": true }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-text",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.text?.message }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty", "singleValue": true }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-filter",
      "name": "E texto de cliente?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [360, 260]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.body.text.message }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Voce e o atendente da empresa no WhatsApp. Responda em portugues do Brasil, em no maximo 3 frases curtas, sem markdown (WhatsApp nao renderiza).\n\nRegras:\n- Nunca invente preco, prazo ou politica. Se nao souber, diga que vai verificar e peca o e-mail.\n- Se o cliente pedir humano, responda que vai transferir e pare de responder.\n- Nao peca dados de cartao, senha ou documento."
        }
      },
      "id": "ai-agent",
      "name": "Atendente IA",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [620, 240],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": { "temperature": 0.3 }
      },
      "id": "llm",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [560, 460],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": { "id": "REPLACE_OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID", "name": "OpenAI account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $('Wafly Inbound').item.json.body.phone }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 12
      },
      "id": "memory",
      "name": "Memoria por telefone",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [740, 460]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendText",
        "phone": "={{ $('Wafly Inbound').item.json.body.phone }}",
        "message": "={{ $json.output }}"
      },
      "id": "wafly-send",
      "name": "Responder no WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-wafly.wafly",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [980, 240],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "credentials": {
        "waflyApi": { "id": "REPLACE_WAFLY_CREDENTIAL_ID", "name": "Wafly account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "noop-ignore",
      "name": "Ignorar (grupo, echo, midia)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [620, 400]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Wafly Inbound": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "E texto de cliente?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "E texto de cliente?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Atendente IA", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Ignorar (grupo, echo, midia)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "OpenAI Chat Model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [[{ "node": "Atendente IA", "type": "ai_languageModel", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Memoria por telefone": {
      "ai_memory": [[{ "node": "Atendente IA", "type": "ai_memory", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Atendente IA": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Responder no WhatsApp", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": { "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false }
}
